      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.33 (up from ₹2.19 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.28b (up 14% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹57.0m (up 6.4% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 4.5% (down from 4.8% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 27% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 17% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
